asl-weather-announce (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New release with resilience patterns and caching improvements.
  * Added LRU cache for location lookups with configurable size.
  * Added circuit breaker protection for external APIs.
  * Added API metrics collection.
  * Added offline mode for time/date announcements only.
  * Removed weather caching (always fetch fresh data).
  * Removed TTL from location cache (postal codes rarely change).

 -- Peter Nearing <me@peternearing.ca>  Fri, 04 Apr 2026 21:30:00 -0400

